  "description": "Codex: Adeptus Custodes (11e) RENDAX ka'tah through the real unit_selected_to_fight window (WP-C3). Fixture cus11e_c3_custodes_active (P1 Custodes, round 2): the Command-phase load readies the Custodes, then the scenario enters the Fight phase. (1) Start of the Fight phase: the new fight_phase_start window offers the Dacatarai / Kaptaris KA'TAH cards for the readied units within 6\" of an enemy — a real click on Decline keeps them readied. (2) Both players end their pile-in. (3) A real click selects the Blade Champion (engaged with the Deff Dread, a VEHICLE) to fight: the unit_selected_to_fight window opens with the 0-CP RENDAX card — P1 has 0 CP (setup privilege, so no paid stratagem / Epic Challenge prompt competes) and the card is still usable. (4) A real click on Use: no CP, the Blade Champion is no longer readied, Rendax is active. (5) Its melee attacks resolve with [LETHAL HITS] against the VEHICLE (dice log hit_roll_melee lethal_hits_weapon, game log). Setup privileges: CP 0 for both players and auto wound allocation (saves are not under test).",
  "fixture": "cus11e_c3_custodes_active",
  "edition": 11,
  "rng_seed": 42,
  "transition_to_phase": 10,
  "disable_ai": true,
  "martial_katah": true,
  "steps": [
    { "act": "wait_seconds", "seconds": 0.8 },
    { "act": "expect_phase", "equals": 10 },
    { "act": "expect_state", "path": "meta.active_player", "equals": 1 },
    { "act": "execute_script", "multiline": true, "comment": "setup privileges (see description)", "script": "GameState.state.players[\"1\"][\"cp\"] = 0\nGameState.state.players[\"2\"][\"cp\"] = 0\nSettingsService.set(\"auto_allocate_wounds\", true)\nreturn true", "equals": true },
    { "act": "expect_state", "path": "units.U_BLADE_CHAMPION_A.flags.cus11e_readied", "equals": true },

    { "act": "expect_node_visible", "node": "/root/StratagemDialog", "timeout_s": 5.0 },
    { "act": "execute_script", "script": "PhaseManager.get_current_phase_instance().get_pending_stratagem_window().window_id", "equals": "fight_phase_start" },
    { "act": "expect_node_visible", "node": "/root/StratagemDialog/Content/StratScroll/StratList/Card_cus11e_katah_dacatarai", "timeout_s": 2.0 },
    { "act": "expect_node_visible", "node": "/root/StratagemDialog/Content/StratScroll/StratList/Card_cus11e_katah_kaptaris", "timeout_s": 2.0 },
    { "act": "screenshot", "label": "01_fight_phase_start_katah_cards" },
